Output src/generated/delete_surround.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/delete_surround.text"
Enter
Show

Type ":"
Type "%"
Type "s"
Type "/"
Type "["
Type "("
Type ")"
Type "]"
Type "/"
Type "/"
Type "g"
Enter

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s